00:03:37.440 --> 00:03:40.610
justice and methods of social inquiry.

00:03:40.610 --> 00:03:42.960
His current research
concerns the relations

00:03:42.960 --> 00:03:46.033
between democracy and the
distribution of income.

00:03:46.870 --> 00:03:50.130
Our second presenter is Akhil Rajan.

00:03:50.130 --> 00:03:53.880
Rajan is a senior at Yale College,

00:03:53.880 --> 00:03:57.140
enrolled in the simultaneous
B.A./M.A. program

00:03:57.140 --> 00:03:58.860
in political science

00:03:58.860 --> 00:04:02.453
and the multidisciplinary
academic program in human rights.

00:04:03.320 --> 00:04:04.950
Rajan studies the intersection

00:04:04.950 --> 00:04:07.280
of political behavior and populism,

00:04:07.280 --> 00:04:08.870
as well as policy responses

00:04:08.870 --> 00:04:11.910
