Effective Democratic Governance

00:04:29.780 --> 00:04:33.110
in the Jackson Institute
for Global Affairs.

00:04:33.110 --> 00:04:36.160
His research focuses on
public policy responses

00:04:36.160 --> 00:04:40.750
